<title>POLAND: GDANSKI MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 10.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 10.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					 10.58 vs   11.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.93 vs   15.57</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 37.10 vs   32.10</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	71.48 vs   61.74</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					 26.21 vs   35.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   42.47 vs   57.85</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		106.84 vs   98.43</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     205.34 vs  178.69</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
